# LeakSanitizer suppressions.
#
# Creating an sf::RenderTexture initializes the system GL driver. Under Xvfb
# that is mesa's libGLX, which keeps process-lifetime allocations that are not
# reachable from our code. Suppress those so a real leak in the project still
# fails the run.
leak:libGLX_mesa
leak:libGLX
leak:libEGL
